OL,4,Q ###R###T###WG  Teletext Recovery      
OL,6,MVHS-Teletext                           
OL,9, A suite of tools for capturing the VBI 
OL,10, from tape and extracting teletext      
OL,11, pages from it.                         
OL,13, The low bandwidth of video tape means  
OL,14, the quality of the teletext signal in  
OL,15, VBI is not normally good enough for    
OL,16, regular decoders to be able to display 
OL,17, pages correctly, but the processing    
OL,18, capabilities of VHS-Teletext corrects  
OL,19, errors and enables most pages to be    
OL,20, successfully recovered.                
OL,22,Cgithub.com/ali1234/vhs-teletext        
