OL,4,Q ###R###T###WG  Teletext Recovery      
OL,6,MDecode-Orc                             
OL,9, A powerful framework for LaserDisc and 
OL,10, tape decoding workflows. Includes      
OL,11, software for decoding various teletext 
OL,12, standards.                             
OL,14, Support for NABTS and the NTSC variant 
OL,15, of WST was added in August 2026,       
OL,16, enabling pages from services using     
OL,17, those technologies to be recovered from
OL,18, VHS for the first time.                
